1511
00:50:47,929 --> 00:50:48,969
(Laughing)

1512
00:50:49,069 --> 00:50:50,069
By the way,

1513
00:50:50,069 --> 00:50:52,769
- you're close with Lee Juck.
- Yes.

1514
00:50:52,769 --> 00:50:54,709
You laugh like him.

1515
00:50:54,869 --> 00:50:56,069
- Do I?
- Yes.

1516
00:50:56,069 --> 00:50:57,409
