- Yes.

1522
00:51:10,389 --> 00:51:12,759
When you spend lots of time together, you become alike.

1523
00:51:12,759 --> 00:51:14,259
- That happens.
- Yes.

1524
00:51:15,129 --> 00:51:16,289
What?

1525
00:51:16,289 --> 00:51:17,999
I brought my wallet just in case.

1526
00:51:17,999 --> 00:51:19,459
And that will become the case.

1527
00:51:20,729 --> 00:51:23,169
We'll see about that.

1528
