- Let's spare 1 person.
- Only 1 person eats comfortably.

1538
00:51:45,489 --> 00:51:46,719
- Only one?
- Yes.

1539
00:51:46,719 --> 00:51:48,889
- Sounds good.
- Only one will eat comfortably.

1540
00:51:49,029 --> 00:51:50,129
- Sounds good.
- Good.

1541
00:51:50,289 --> 00:51:52,029
Let's spin it. One will be saved.

1542
00:51:52,029 --> 00:51:53,099
Okay.

1543
00:51:53,399 --> 00:51:54,569
I'll spin it.

1544
00:51:56,429 --> 00:51:57,639
It has to be me.

1545
00:51:57,999 --> 00:51:59,399
- It should be me.
- I want to eat comfortably.

1546
00:51:59,399 --> 00:52:00,639
I just want to enjoy the meal.

1547
00:52:03,009 --> 00:52:04,269
We'll spare one person.

1548
00:52:04,269 --> 00:52:06,539
- I have a good feeling today.
- It pointed at me before.

1549
00:52:07,309 --> 00:52:09,179
(Who will be the lucky 1 person who gets to eat in peace?)

1550
00:52:09,179 --> 00:52:10,509
It's me.

1551
00:52:10,509 --> 00:52:12,019
(Who will be the lucky 1 person who gets to eat in peace?)

1552
00:52:13,279 --> 00:52:15,189
(Jae Seok is exempt from paying for the meal.)

1553
00:52:15,349 --> 00:52:16,419
Darn it.

1554
00:52:16,419 --> 00:52:17,659
