Gosh. It's no fun.

1556
00:52:22,189 --> 00:52:24,729
I brought my wallet, though.

1557
00:52:24,729 --> 00:52:25,799
(It's super fun.)

1558
00:52:26,759 --> 00:52:29,029
Gosh. Thanks to the younger ones,

1559
00:52:29,199 --> 00:52:30,769
