- I'm at an Italian restaurant...

1560
00:52:31,499 --> 00:52:33,269
after a long time.

1561
00:52:33,669 --> 00:52:36,539
- Is it all right?
- We have no problem paying for it.

1562
00:52:36,539 --> 00:52:39,079
But hearing him speaking like that throughout the meal...

1563
00:52:39,079 --> 00:52:40,409
We have to keep hearing it.

1564
00:52:40,409 --> 00:52:41,579
That's the problem.

1565
00:52:41,949 --> 00:52:44,449
The satisfied look on his face bothers me so much.

1566
00:52:45,049 --> 00:52:46,179
What? It's here.

1567
00:52:46,719 --> 00:52:48,689
