- Thank you.

1568
00:52:50,149 --> 00:52:52,159
Let's forget about the game we just played.

1569
00:52:52,159 --> 00:52:54,289
Why don't we see who can stretch the cheese the longest?

1570
00:52:54,629 --> 00:52:56,189
I'll take a piece now.

1571
00:52:57,959 --> 00:52:59,659
You three can decide.

1572
00:52:59,659 --> 00:53:01,069
- It's on us.
- Yes.

1573
00:53:01,799 --> 00:53:03,899
- You can pick one first.
- Anything's fine.

1574
00:53:04,169 --> 00:53:06,599
Is this condensed milk? You can dip it in honey.

1575
00:53:07,139 --> 00:53:08,409
The cheese pizza.

1576
00:53:08,409 --> 00:53:09,909
(Satisfied)

1577
00:53:11,739 --> 00:53:12,879
It's good.

1578
00:53:13,909 --> 00:53:15,649
(Finally recharging the energy spent on the game)

1579
00:53:15,649 --> 00:53:16,749
- It's tasty, isn't it?
- Yes.

1580
00:53:17,479 --> 00:53:18,619
I'm hungry.

1581
00:53:18,619 --> 00:53:19,619
(Finally recharging the energy spent on the game)

1582
00:53:20,019 --> 00:53:21,219
- It's good.
- It's tasty.

1583
00:53:21,219 --> 00:53:22,289
(Stretched cheese)

1584
00:53:22,289 --> 00:53:24,289
It tastes so good because I haven't had it in a while.

1585
00:53:24,959 --> 00:53:26,859
It tastes even better since it's been a while.

1586
00:53:28,629 --> 00:53:29,689
Exactly.

1587
00:53:30,329 --> 00:53:32,459
- Gosh.
- It's so good.

1588
00:53:32,629 --> 00:53:34,969
The wood-fired Gorgonzola pizza is so good.

1589
00:53:35,669 --> 00:53:37,229
Gosh. You're really enjoying it.

1590
00:53:37,629 --> 00:53:38,899
It's flavorful.

1591
00:53:38,899 --> 00:53:39,899
(Overreacting)

1592
00:53:40,669 --> 00:53:43,239
I don't want you to enjoy it so much.

1593
00:53:43,769 --> 00:53:44,879
It's so tasty.

1594
00:53:45,379 --> 00:53:46,839
It tastes even better as it's free.

1595
00:53:46,839 --> 00:53:47,879
It's free.

1596
00:53:49,209 --> 00:53:50,309
It tastes better when it's free.

1597
00:53:50,309 --> 00:53:53,219
(After having the free pizza...)

1598
00:53:53,219 --> 00:53:55,049
The pasta noodles already look good.

1599
00:53:55,319 --> 00:53:57,219
(Giving it to Yeon Shik first)

1600
00:53:57,219 --> 00:53:59,759
Right. You should at least serve it when you're not paying.

1601
00:54:01,089 --> 00:54:03,529
Have just a little bit because you might pay, Woo Jae.

1602
00:54:06,399 --> 00:54:09,769
