1603
00:54:10,699 --> 00:54:12,069
They must've learned how to cook it in Italy.

1604
00:54:12,069 --> 00:54:13,569
(Yeon Seok and Park focus on the meal,)

1605
00:54:13,569 --> 00:54:15,039
(forgetting about the bet.)

1606
00:54:15,039 --> 00:54:16,309
I can totally smell the prawns.

1607
00:54:17,539 --> 00:54:21,009
(And here's the one staying away from the table.)

1608
00:54:21,579 --> 00:54:24,149
(Chewing half-heartedly)

1609
00:54:25,149 --> 00:54:26,249
It's good.

1610
00:54:26,819 --> 00:54:28,319
I think Woo Jae's full.

1611
00:54:29,519 --> 00:54:31,219
I'm ready to play the next game.

1612
00:54:31,219 --> 00:54:32,259
Right?

1613
00:54:34,319 --> 00:54:35,659
Come to think of it,

1614
00:54:36,059 --> 00:54:38,029
I'm a member of SBS now.

1615
00:54:38,229 --> 00:54:39,699
