1618
00:54:45,539 --> 00:54:48,009
- Congratulations.
- Gosh. It's really...

1619
00:54:48,169 --> 00:54:49,869
Many teenagers are on the show.

1620
00:54:49,909 --> 00:54:51,539
- I see.
- It must be touching.

1621
00:54:51,539 --> 00:54:52,979
- It's really moving.
- I bet.

1622
00:54:52,979 --> 00:54:55,509
Many people have so many desperate stories.

1623
00:54:55,509 --> 00:54:56,679
They're such good singers too.

1624
00:54:57,149 --> 00:54:58,879
There are so many good singers in Korea.

1625
00:54:58,879 --> 00:55:00,349
- You're right.
- There are so many.

1626
00:55:00,819 --> 00:55:02,289
Koreans are...

1627
00:55:02,449 --> 00:55:04,419
naturally gifted at singing.

1628
00:55:04,419 --> 00:55:05,519
They're so good.

1629
00:55:05,659 --> 00:55:07,219
- Thank you.
- Thank you.

1630
00:55:07,219 --> 00:55:08,359
Thank you.

1631
00:55:08,629 --> 00:55:10,889
(Finishing it with a smoky and buttery flavor)

1632
00:55:10,889 --> 00:55:12,029
- Goodness.
- Thank you.

1633
00:55:12,029 --> 00:55:13,959
We have to have our proteins.

1634
00:55:14,059 --> 00:55:15,669
You'll get a bite at least, right, Woo Jae?

1635
00:55:15,869 --> 00:55:16,899
Just a tiny bit.

1636
00:55:17,269 --> 00:55:18,599
It's well cooked.

1637
00:55:19,539 --> 00:55:20,739
It looks good.

1638
00:55:21,369 --> 00:55:22,639
The meat is really cooked well.

1639
00:55:22,809 --> 00:55:24,539
When I look at the meat, I can tell.

1640
00:55:24,679 --> 00:55:26,009
(The meat lets him forget that he's full.)

1641
00:55:26,009 --> 00:55:27,809
Gosh, Woo Jae. You have to have it.

1642
00:55:27,879 --> 00:55:29,149
Yes. You have to eat it.

1643
00:55:29,449 --> 00:55:31,219
- It's tasty.
- It's cooked so well.

1644
00:55:31,219 --> 00:55:33,019
Every dish tastes great here.

1645
00:55:33,019 --> 00:55:34,549
(Savoring)

1646
00:55:34,689 --> 00:55:35,749
Gosh.

1647
00:55:37,689 --> 00:55:39,989
(Taking another bite even though he's full)

1648
00:55:40,389 --> 00:55:41,859
You're eating quite a bit today.

1649
00:55:42,359 --> 00:55:44,329
- Yes.
- Because he might pay for it.

1650
00:55:44,699 --> 00:55:45,799
- That's why.
- He doesn't hesitate to eat.

1651
00:55:45,799 --> 00:55:47,659
In fact, I'm shoving it in a bit.

1652
00:55:48,829 --> 00:55:50,829
- Because I might pay for it.
- You should.

1653
00:55:50,829 --> 00:55:53,099
Like I always said, if you're scared, get out.

1654
00:55:54,299 --> 00:55:55,339
Woo Jae...

1655
00:55:56,269 --> 00:55:58,809
I can picture him getting the knife.

1656
00:56:00,109 --> 00:56:02,209
- At the end?
- Yes. Like this.

1657
00:56:02,309 --> 00:56:04,849
I can see the knife pointing at you.

1658
00:56:05,249 --> 00:56:06,979
- I'll spin it.
- Okay.

1659
00:56:07,449 --> 00:56:08,649
The person it points to will pay.

1660
00:56:08,649 --> 00:56:09,789
Here we go.

1661
00:56:10,089 --> 00:56:11,619
One, two, three.

1662
00:56:11,619 --> 00:56:14,159
(Whoever the knife points to will pay for the meal.)

1663
00:56:14,359 --> 00:56:18,229
(The stakes got higher after ordering the steak.)

1664
00:56:18,229 --> 00:56:19,629
It won't be me.

1665
00:56:19,629 --> 00:56:23,399
(The knife points to...)

1666
00:56:23,399 --> 00:56:24,569
- What?
- It's Woo Jae.

1667
00:56:25,639 --> 00:56:27,469
Goodness.

1668
00:56:27,739 --> 00:56:29,739
(Woo Jae will pay.)

1669
00:56:29,739 --> 00:56:31,879
- This is amazing.
- I was correct.

1670
00:56:32,379 --> 00:56:35,479
(Happier than anyone else)

1671
00:56:36,279 --> 00:56:37,779
The picture I saw...

1672
00:56:37,779 --> 00:56:38,949
- That was exactly it.
- Gosh.

1673
00:56:38,949 --> 00:56:41,349
My gut has been spot-on lately.

1674
00:56:41,419 --> 00:56:43,889
- Gosh.
- Woo Jae treats me a lot.

1675
00:56:44,019 --> 00:56:46,319
- Woo Jae will pay for the meal.
- Thanks for the meal.

1676
00:56:46,459 --> 00:56:48,559
- Thanks for lunch, Woo Jae.
- Thank you.

1677
00:56:49,059 --> 00:56:50,089
- Gosh, Woo Jae.
- Woo Jae.

1678
00:56:50,089 --> 00:56:51,629
- You'll pay because you lost.
- Thank you.

1679
00:56:51,629 --> 00:56:52,759
I'll go and brush my teeth.

1680
00:56:55,169 --> 00:56:56,229
Gosh. I'm full.

1681
00:57:00,139 --> 00:57:01,339
