1682
00:57:02,239 --> 00:57:03,469
I'm getting a blood sugar spike.

1683
00:57:03,469 --> 00:57:05,439
(A food coma hits after a hearty meal.)

1684
00:57:05,839 --> 00:57:08,749
They gave us candies to refresh our palates.

1685
00:57:09,009 --> 00:57:11,249
- Let's try them.
- It wakes you up, right?

1686
00:57:11,249 --> 00:57:13,319
Have it when you're sleepy after a meal.

1687
00:57:13,319 --> 00:57:14,349
- I'm a bit sleepy.
- Right.

1688
00:57:14,349 --> 00:57:16,249
- I'm drowsy.
- Take one when you're drowsy.

1689
00:57:16,749 --> 00:57:19,659
Gosh. Is menthol the refreshing ingredient?

1690
00:57:20,659 --> 00:57:21,829
We're supposed to eat it like this.

1691
00:57:22,259 --> 00:57:23,759
We're really supposed to eat it like that.

1692
00:57:23,759 --> 00:57:24,929
You crunch into it.

1693
00:57:24,929 --> 00:57:25,959
Crunch.

1694
00:57:27,499 --> 00:57:29,199
- Gosh. I love its texture.
- It's tasty.

1695
00:57:29,669 --> 00:57:31,299
It clears my nose at once.

1696
00:57:32,939 --> 00:57:33,999
I'm totally awake now.

1697
00:57:34,299 --> 00:57:36,209
- This...
- It woke me right up.

1698
00:57:36,839 --> 00:57:38,179
- We need to stay alert.
- Yes.

1699
00:57:38,179 --> 00:57:40,139
We need to be fully awake to play the second game.

1700
00:57:40,139 --> 00:57:42,049
We can play the game after taking this one.

1701
00:57:42,049 --> 00:57:43,779
- Let's pull it off.
- I'm fully awake now.

1702
00:57:44,149 --> 00:57:45,179
(Woo Jae pays.)

1703
00:57:45,179 --> 00:57:46,949
- Did you enjoy the meal?
- Yes, it was so good.

1704
00:57:47,179 --> 00:57:48,689
It would've tasted even better if I didn't pay for it.

1705
00:57:50,449 --> 00:57:51,519
We can hop in that one.

1706
