- You enjoyed it...

1712
00:58:04,069 --> 00:58:06,239
- more than anyone.
- It was really good.

1713
00:58:06,299 --> 00:58:07,899
It kept hitting my palate.

1714
00:58:08,869 --> 00:58:11,679
(Laughing)

1715
00:58:11,679 --> 00:58:13,509
If Woo Jae went there alone, he would've ordered only one dish.

1716
00:58:13,509 --> 00:58:15,609
- Gosh.
- One dish would be enough.

1717
00:58:15,609 --> 00:58:16,879
He'd only have one pasta.

1718
00:58:16,879 --> 00:58:18,479
I could keep it under 12 dollars.

1719
00:58:20,549 --> 00:58:23,119
