1720
00:58:23,549 --> 00:58:24,759
A few pieces would be enough.

1721
00:58:24,989 --> 00:58:26,789
We'll do our best at our next spot.

1722
00:58:27,589 --> 00:58:29,429
Gosh. I'm nervous again. This is bad.

1723
00:58:30,859 --> 00:58:33,159
My stomach starts to hurt from nervousness.

1724
00:58:33,399 --> 00:58:34,429
Really?

1725
00:58:35,229 --> 00:58:36,869
Actually, Park.

1726
00:58:36,869 --> 00:58:39,799
You don't really get nervous.

1727
00:58:39,799 --> 00:58:42,709
I've been on a lot of survival shows.

1728
00:58:43,539 --> 00:58:46,309
I think I do better...

1729
00:58:46,309 --> 00:58:48,179
- in nervous situations.
- I think you do.

1730
00:58:48,579 --> 00:58:49,849
- You looked relaxed.
- That's right.

1731
00:58:50,109 --> 00:58:51,879
He should've had a breakdown.

1732
00:58:51,879 --> 00:58:53,849
- He's like that.
- But he stood strong.

1733
00:58:53,849 --> 00:58:56,189
When I played games...

1734
00:58:56,189 --> 00:58:57,919
- on other shows, - Yes.

1735
00:58:57,919 --> 00:59:00,519
the clutch time would arrive, and I...

1736
00:59:01,189 --> 00:59:03,189
- Did you become calmer?
- I did well.

1737
00:59:03,829 --> 00:59:05,829
Without any tension,

1738
00:59:05,829 --> 00:59:07,929
- I kind of fizzle out.
- I see.

1739
00:59:08,269 --> 00:59:11,369
Gosh. It'll make a great picture if this comment...

1740
00:59:11,639 --> 00:59:14,269
