1741
00:59:14,369 --> 00:59:16,209
- Right. This is...
- Yes.

1742
00:59:16,209 --> 00:59:17,309
I don't know how they'll use what I just said.

1743
00:59:17,309 --> 00:59:18,379
- It's...
- From an editing perspective...

1744
00:59:18,379 --> 00:59:19,879
That would be the perfect editing.

1745
00:59:19,879 --> 00:59:23,509
John, what we say often comes true on this show.

1746
00:59:24,079 --> 00:59:26,319
I think I owned Chapter One.

1747
00:59:26,719 --> 00:59:28,189
- And you'll own Chapter Two.
- Really?

1748
00:59:28,689 --> 00:59:30,889
